What improved
Prior blocker around Cursor role:* and type:"human" normalization is fixed.
Cross-format tests were added for those specific cases.
Remaining test gap
No coverage yet for Gemini/Factory/OpenCode/Copilot transcript shapes in compact tests, so “any agent” behavior is still unproven.

